2.
A note- it is easy to ignore bows and arrows but they really do the most damage
with the littlest risk. 
An elven bow (with an arrow I assume) does 35 damage on small. and some 
lesser amount on large.
I have been playing a wimpy char and I have saved my but from Rust monsters and
all kinds of other stuff with poisoned arrows. 


